config OPENCV
    bool "Build with OpenCV (static, compiled from source)"
    default n
    help
      OpenCV 4.13 as static libraries linked into the application. They
      are compiled from the source archive of the component the first
      time a compiler needs them. The board image does not need to
      provide OpenCV.

if OPENCV

config OPENCV_MODULES
    string "OpenCV modules"
    default "core,imgproc,imgcodecs"
    help
      Comma separated list of the OpenCV modules to build; their
      dependencies are added automatically. The shipped source archive
      contains core, imgproc and imgcodecs (JPEG, PNG); for others point
      OPENCV_SOURCE_ARCHIVE at a complete OpenCV source archive.

endif
